{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36909","headline":"钱唐见芮逢 · 罗隐","name":"钱唐见芮逢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蔡伦池北雁峰前，罹乱相兼十九年。\n所喜故人犹会面，不堪良牧已重泉。\n醉思把筯欹歌席，狂忆判身入酒船。\n今日与君赢得在，戴家湾里两皤然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36909.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36909","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}